#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qubit properties {#qubit-properties}"
msgstr "Propriedades dos qubits {#qubit-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Jump to the list of qubit properties](#view-qubit-properties)\n"
msgstr "[Ir para a lista de propriedades dos qubits](#view-qubit-properties)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`backend.properties().qubit_property()` returns information about the "
"qubits' physical attributes. It contains a dictionary of various properties "
"of the qubit, each paired with its value and the timestamp of the last "
"calibration.\n"
msgstr ""
"`backend.properties().qubit_property()` retorna informações sobre os "
"atributos físicos dos qubits. Ele contém um dicionário de várias "
"propriedades do qubit, cada uma associada ao seu valor e ao timestamp da "
"última calibração.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code examples demonstrate how to list all properties, or "
"retrieve specific properties, of a particular qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Os exemplos de código a seguir demonstram como listar todas as propriedades "
"ou recuperar propriedades específicas de um qubit em particular.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View qubit properties {#view-qubit-properties}"
msgstr "Ver propriedades dos qubits {#view-qubit-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Relaxation time)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Relaxation time)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The $T_1$ time represents the average duration a qubit remains in its "
"excited state $|1\\rangle$ before decaying to its ground state $|0\\rangle$ "
"due to energy relaxation. This parameter is used to characterize the qubit's"
" energy relaxation behavior, and is expressed in units of seconds (s).\n"
msgstr ""
"O tempo $T_1$ representa a duração média em que um qubit permanece em seu "
"estado excitado $|1\\rangle$ antes de decair para seu estado fundamental "
"$|0\\rangle$ devido ao relaxamento de energia. Esse parâmetro é usado para "
"caracterizar o comportamento de relaxamento de energia do qubit e é expresso"
" em unidades de segundos (s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t1(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_1$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t1(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_1$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"t2\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T2` (Dephasing time)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"t2\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T2` (Dephasing time)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The $T_2$ time denotes the timescale over which a qubit maintains phase "
"coherence of a superposition between the $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ "
"states. It accounts for both energy relaxation and pure dephasing processes,"
" providing insight into the qubit's coherence properties. $T_2$ is reported "
"from a Hahn echo sequence.\n"
msgstr ""
"O tempo $T_2$ denota a escala de tempo sobre a qual um qubit mantém a "
"coerência de fase de uma superposição entre os estados $|0\\rangle$ e "
"$|1\\rangle$. Ele leva em conta tanto o relaxamento de energia quanto os "
"processos de defasagem pura, fornecendo insights sobre as propriedades de "
"coerência do qubit. $T_2$ é reportado a partir de uma sequência de eco de "
"Hahn.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t2(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_2$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t2(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_2$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction properties {#instruction-properties}"
msgstr "Propriedades das instruções {#instruction-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Jump to the list of instruction properties](#view-instruction-properties)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Ir para a lista de propriedades das instruções](#view-instruction-"
"properties)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend.target` attribute is a "
"[`qiskit.transpiler.Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" object: an object that contains all the information needed to transpile a "
"circuit for that backend. This includes instruction errors and durations. "
"For example, the following cell gets the properties for a [`cz` "
"gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate)"
" acting between qubits 1 and 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"O atributo `backend.target` é um objeto "
"[`qiskit.transpiler.Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):"
" um objeto que contém todas as informações necessárias para transpilar um "
"circuito para aquele backend. Isso inclui erros e durações das instruções. "
"Por exemplo, a célula a seguir obtém as propriedades de uma [porta "
"`cz`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate)"
" agindo entre os qubits 1 e 0.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following cell shows the properties for a measurement operation "
"(including the readout error) on qubit 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"A célula a seguir mostra as propriedades de uma operação de medição "
"(incluindo o erro de leitura) no qubit 0.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View instruction properties {#view-instruction-properties}"
msgstr "Ver propriedades das instruções {#view-instruction-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas0-prep1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas0-prep1\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas0-prep1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas0-prep1\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This parameter indicates the probability of measuring a qubit in the 0 state"
" when it was intended to be prepared in the $|1\\rangle$ state, denoted as "
"$P(0 | 1)$. It reflects errors in state preparation and measurement (SPAM), "
"particularly measurement errors in superconducting qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este parâmetro indica a probabilidade de medir um qubit no estado 0 quando "
"ele deveria ter sido preparado no estado $|1\\rangle$, denotado como $P(0 | "
"1)$. Ele reflete erros na preparação de estado e medição (SPAM), "
"particularmente erros de medição em qubits supercondutores.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep1')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep1')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, qubit dropdown menu</td>\n"
